{
  "title": "KNX topology: couplers, repeater, and KNXnet/IP routers",
  "description": "Two areas are connected by an IP network. KNXnet/IP routers 1.0.0 and 2.0.0 act as area couplers. The installation has four lines, a line extension, and a supervisor on the IP network. Compare the route of a local command with that of a status telegram.",
